/*
 * TABLA-PEDIDOS BUTTON LAYOUT IMPROVEMENTS
 * ==========================================
 *
 * This patch file contains comprehensive improvements for the tracking buttons
 * in the orders table component. Apply these changes to tabla-pedidos.component.scss
 *
 * ISSUES FIXED:
 * 1. Cramped/crowded button spacing - Now using consistent 8px/12px gaps
 * 2. Poor text color contrast on Enviame buttons - Now using solid colors with white text
 * 3. Inconsistent button alignment - All buttons now stretch to fill container width
 * 4. Poor touch targets - Increased min-height to 36px for better accessibility
 * 5. Responsive design issues - Improved mobile layout with appropriate sizing
 *
 * KEY IMPROVEMENTS:
 * - Consistent spacing using 4px multiples (8px, 12px, etc.)
 * - Solid background colors instead of gradients for better contrast
 * - White text on all colored buttons for WCAG AA compliance
 * - Better button organization with max-width constraints
 * - Improved mobile responsiveness
 */

/* REPLACE THIS BLOCK (lines ~487-501): */
/* OLD:
// Estilos para la columna de seguimiento
